    "q_en": "A solid metallic cylinder of radius 6 cm and height 15 cm is melted and recast into 9 identical right circular cones, each having a base radius of 6 cm. Find the height of each cone.",
    "q_hi": "6 cm त्रिज्या और 15 cm ऊँचाई वाले ठोस धातु के बेलन को पिघलाकर 9 एकसमान लम्ब वृत्तीय शंकुओं में ढाला जाता है, जिनमें से प्रत्येक शंकु की आधार त्रिज्या 6 cm है। प्रत्येक शंकु की ऊँचाई ज्ञात कीजिए।",
    "section": "Arithmetic1",
    "solution": "<b>Solution (EN):</b> Volume of cylinder = &pi; &times; r<sup>2</sup> &times; h = &pi; &times; 6<sup>2</sup> &times; 15.<br>Volume of 9 cones = 9 &times; (1/3) &times; &pi; &times; r<sup>2</sup> &times; H = 3 &times; &pi; &times; 6<sup>2</sup> &times; H.<br>Equating volumes: &pi; &times; 36 &times; 15 = 3 &times; &pi; &times; 36 &times; H.<br>15 = 3H &rArr; H = 5 cm.<br><b>Solution (HI):</b> बेलन का आयतन = &pi; &times; r<sup>2</sup> &times; h = &pi; &times; 6<sup>2</sup> &times; 15.<br>9 शंकुओं का आयतन = 9 &times; (1/3) &times; &pi; &times; r<sup>2</sup> &times; H = 3 &times; &pi; &times; 6<sup>2</sup> &times; H.<br>आयतनों को बराबर करने पर: &pi; &times; 36 &times; 15 = 3 &times; &pi; &times; 36 &times; H.<br>15 = 3H &rArr; H = 5 cm.<br><b>Short Trick:</b> Vol<sub>Cylinder</sub> = 9 &times; Vol<sub>Cone</sub> &rArr; &pi; r<sup>2</sup> h = 9 &times; (1/3) &pi; r<sup>2</sup> H. Since 'r' is same, h = 3H. 15 = 3H &rArr; H = 5.",
    "topic": "Mensuration"
  },
